  "summary": "I am a graduate of Polytechnic Institute on 05/15/2021 with a Bachelor of Science in Computer Science. I have always had a passion for both Computer hardware and software and how they work. Growing up I always was on my computer learning new things about computers and software and how they work.\n\nAs I've been working as a Retail Sales Associate while going to college, I have developed some wonderful communication skills. And during my college years so far I am great at staying organized and having amazing time management. I can either work in groups or alone whichever is needed to get a job done I am content with. Through the classes I have taken I have learned how to program from websites to executable files. I have knowledge on how to use both ins and outs of Linux and Windows operating systems. As I continue my college journey and as I get into the Computer Science field I'm looking to expand my knowledge and skill set in the field of everything Computer Science related.",
